      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '



    Welcome Commander.


    Your mission is to dominate the battlefield

    and
    destroy all enemy ships using tactical

    movement and positioning across the
    hex grid.


    GAMEPLAY


    - Each player controls one ship

    - Players
    take turns moving and attacking

    - Use terrain obstacles for tactical advantage

    -
    Plan your moves carefully

    - Destroy all enemy ships to win


    CONTROLS


    -
    Press M to activate movement mode

    - Click a valid tile to move your ship

    - 
    Press A to activate attack mode

    - Click an enemy ship to attack

    - Use
    Mouse Wheel to zoom in and out


    TACTICAL TIPS


    - Stay out of enemy
    range

    - Control important positions

    - Plan your movement carefully

    -
    Use distance to survive longer


    VICTORY CONDITION


    Destroy every enemy
    ship to claim victory.'
